      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lowell%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town’s Labor Day Parade, held every year, is the oldest continuously running parade in Indiana.",
